# The LED starts dark. Then PWM on D9 lights it for a short part of each 2 ms period, and as the
# sketch fades it up, for most of each period.
open
step 10ms
expect @led1 off
step --until @nano.D9 high --timeout 50ms
step 1ms
expect @nano.D9 low
expect @led1 off
step 1400ms
step --until @nano.D9 low --timeout 3ms
step 1ms
expect @nano.D9 high
expect @led1 on
expect no diagnostics
